Chapter: CvmmDisplayTable
  cites Cvmm chapter DisplayLive
  cites Cvmm chapter DisplayManager
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Booted with a 1024x768 GOP framebuffer (the sidecar). The view reads the mode
 codex-vm handed over; writing a different mode into the handoff cells moves
 it; a zero width is no framebuffer and no row.

Section: Report

  dt-line : Text, DisplayManagerState -> Text
  dt-line (tag) (st) =
    if st.disp-monitor-count == 0 then tag & " gpus " & show (st.disp-gpu-count) & " monitors 0"
    else let m = list-at (st.disp-monitors) 0
    in tag & " gpus " & show (st.disp-gpu-count) & " monitors " & show (st.disp-monitor-count) & " " & m.mon-id & " " & show ((m.mon-resolution).res-width) & "x" & show ((m.mon-resolution).res-height) & " on " & m.mon-gpu-id

Section: Entry
  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (dt-line "handed" dm-live)
    let a = poke-32 dl-cell-w 0 800
    in let b = poke-32 dl-cell-h 0 600
    in print-line-uni (dt-line "rewritten" dm-live)
    print-line-uni (dt-line "none" (dm-from-mode 0 0))
  end